{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>From my youth he grew me up as a father</b> — he grew the orphan with me." "<b>As a mother</b> — he returned to the widow. And some say: \"For from my youth he grew with me the orphan, and from my mother's womb I was her righteousness\" — and the first is more correct, because it is joined with the verses above and below."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:04:08.311224247Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}